   "notes": "The paper spells out the entire recipe in one sentence with every salt and trace metal explicitly listed; it cites no base-medium reference and uses no named trace/vitamin stock, so nothing is hidden. No thiamine, biotin, molybdate, borate, Ni, Se, EDTA, or MOPS are present. Antibiotics/inducers (kanamycin, carbenicillin, chloramphenicol, spectinomycin, aTc) are added only 'when required' and are not medium components. Grown aerobically (shaking, 220 rpm) at 30/37/42 C. Current_components ion set already matched all these compounds; concentrations added and medium confirmed complete."
